---
// Mapping Prometheus Counters, Gauges, and Histogram buckets to RED & USE signals across Go HTTP services.
const W = 900;
const H = 278;
---
<figure class="gofsm">
  <div class="gofsm-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Diagram mapping Prometheus Counter, Gauge, and Histogram metrics cleanly to RED request duration percentiles and USE CPU/memory saturation signals.">
      {/* Left panel: RED HTTP Request Signals */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="430" height="250" rx="10" class="gofsm-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gofsm-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Request-Driven (RED): Counters + Histograms</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Theo dõi Request (RED): Counter + Histogram</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="398" height="54" rx="6" class="gofsm-box" />
      <text x="44" y="81" class="gofsm-b">Rate &amp; Errors -&gt; CounterVec + rate(metric[1m])</text>
      <text x="44" y="99" class="gofsm-m">http_requests_total{'{'}route="/pay", code="5xx"{'}'}</text>

      <rect x="30" y="124" width="398" height="72" rx="6" class="gofsm-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="145" class="gofsm-b-ok">Duration -&gt; Histogram _bucket + histogram_quantile(0.99)</text>
      <text x="44" y="164" class="gofsm-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>99 requests @ 5 ms + 1 request @ 705 ms = mean 12 ms (Hides outage!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>99 call @ 5 ms + 1 call @ 705 ms = trung bình 12 ms (Che lấp sự cố!)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="182" class="gofsm-b-ok">Buckets le="0.01", "0.05", "0.5" reveal p99 = 700 ms!</text>

      <rect x="30" y="208" width="398" height="42" rx="6" class="gofsm-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="233" class="gofsm-b-red">Cardinality rule: NEVER put user_id or full URL in labels!</text>

      {/* Right panel: USE Hardware & Runtime Saturation */}
      <rect x="460" y="14" width="426" height="250" rx="10" class="gofsm-card" />
      <text x="476" y="42" class="gofsm-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Resource-Driven (USE): Utilization &amp; Saturation</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Theo dõi Tài nguyên (USE): Độ bận &amp; Hàng đợi bão hòa</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="476" y="60" width="394" height="58" rx="6" class="gofsm-box" />
      <text x="490" y="81" class="gofsm-b">CPU Utilization + CFS Throttling (Saturation)</text>
      <text x="490" y="99" class="gofsm-m">rate(process_cpu_seconds_total[1m]) + cfs_throttled_seconds</text>

      <rect x="476" y="128" width="394" height="58" rx="6" class="gofsm-box" />
      <text x="490" y="149" class="gofsm-b">Memory Triangulation: OS Working Set vs Go HeapInuse</text>
      <text x="490" y="167" class="gofsm-m">WorkingSet spikes w/ flat HeapInuse -&gt; Cgo/stacks/mmap leak!</text>

      <rect x="476" y="196" width="394" height="54" rx="6" class="gofsm-box is-ok" />
      <text x="490" y="217" class="gofsm-b-ok">Bridge to Profiling: PromQL -&gt; Exemplar -&gt; pprof</text>
      <text x="490" y="235" class="gofsm-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Metrics detect WHICH service &amp; WHEN; pprof pinpoints line.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Metrics chỉ SERVICE &amp; THỜI ĐIỂM; pprof chỉ đúng DÒNG CODE.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Pair RED (Request Rate, Errors, Histogram Duration) for user impact with USE (Utilization, Saturation, Errors) on CPU throttling and RAM tiers before firing up pprof.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Kết hợp RED (tốc độ request, lỗi, Histogram phân vị đuôi) phía API với USE (độ bận CPU, tắc nghẽn cgroup throttling, mức RAM) trước khi bật pprof mổ xẻ dòng code.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gofsm { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gofsm-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gofsm svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 660px; height: auto; }
  .gofsm text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gofsm-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gofsm-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gofsm-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gofsm-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gofsm-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gofsm-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gofsm-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gofsm-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gofsm-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gofsm-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gofsm-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gofsm figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
